# A KairosChain instance, created by running the CLI with this directory as the
# working directory -- `kairos-chain upgrade --apply` here installs eleven
# SkillSets and projects Claude Code artifacts, all of it instance-local.
#
# Keeping it is useful: it is a working instance to test installs against. None of
# it belongs in a package repository, and two pieces must not be published at all.
# CLAUDE.md points at .claude/kairos/instruction_mode.md, which is the author's
# personal instruction mode; .mcp.json carries an absolute path from one machine.
.kairos/
.claude/
.mcp.json
CLAUDE.md
command.log

# Local config chosen by the installing operator, if edited in place.
# The tracked config/*.yml are the shipped defaults.
*.local.yml

.DS_Store
*.gem

log/

# Research data, held out of the repository by the author's decision (2026-09-01).
# NOT because it is disposable -- the opposite. docs/research/prior_art_survey_20260901/
# is the evidence behind the "61 systems" claim in the Prototype Fund application, and it
# exists precisely because an earlier survey left no persisted list. It is ignored here
# only until the author decides where it should be published. Remove this rule at that
# point; do not let the rule become the reason the data is lost a second time.
docs/research/

# Python bytecode from the report generators under docs/reports.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
